## 1️⃣ Cheapest Hangzhou → Seoul → Dallas itinerary (Economy)

| Leg | Airline / Flight | Departure (local) | Arrival (local) | Flight time | Remarks |
|-----|------------------|-------------------|-----------------|-------------|---------|
